From: StanleyYP Wang <StanleyYP.Wang@mediatek.com>
Subject: [PATCH] cfg80211: keep background radar ownership until CAC abort

The abort helper checks background_radar_wdev before cancelling delayed
work and reporting the event. Release ownership only after that helper
returns, while still holding the existing wiphy lock.

Signed-off-by: StanleyYP Wang <StanleyYP.Wang@mediatek.com>

--- a/net/wireless/mlme.c
+++ b/net/wireless/mlme.c
@@ -1282,9 +1282,9 @@
 		return;
 
 	rdev_set_radar_background(rdev, NULL);
-	rdev->background_radar_wdev = NULL; /* Release offchain ownership */
 
 	__cfg80211_background_cac_event(rdev, wdev,
 					&rdev->background_radar_chandef,
 					NL80211_RADAR_CAC_ABORTED);
+	rdev->background_radar_wdev = NULL; /* Release offchain ownership */
 }
